ain","commit_sha":"6b31becd4c5f309a4655334a4bc29af624e40af6","github_link":"https://github.com/MatterHackers/agg-sharp/commit/6b31becd4c5f309a4655334a4bc29af624e40af6","commit_subject":"Markdown emphasis renders as written: *x* and _x_ are italic, **x** and __x__ bold, ***x*** both (single emphasis was bold). The shipped fonts have no italic face, so TextWidget.Italic shears the current face through a new per-face StyledTypeFace.FauxItalic (the rich text editor's 0.2 slant), kept across Bold and size changes; the process-wide TextStyleSettings still apply only to faces that opt in. FauxItalic is part of a printer's render identity, so the GPU text mask and LCD mask caches give an italic run its own mask instead of sharing the upright one. An emphasis span styles every word below it, so nested spans and links inside emphasis pick it up, and copying italic text as HTML gives <em>.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"Actual-Chat/actual-chat","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-01T14:15:24Z","branch":"dev","commit_sha":"24f3c3a3385f8e1603a34a1e03e080fa3e8b2c5e","github_link":"https://github.com/Actual-Chat/actual-chat/commit/24f3c3a3385f8e1603a34a1e03e080fa3e8b2c5e","commit_subject":"fix(l10n): keep the detected UI language on a first visit","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"hoprnet/hoprnet","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-01T14:15:11Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"7d02e753763cbf0bacd89a84e735f8f4233713a4","github_link":"https://github.com/hoprnet/hoprnet/commit/7d02e753763cbf0bacd89a84e735f8f4233713a4","commit_subject":"feat(transport): surface return-path relayer-diversity blind spots (master) (#8464)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"jitsucom/jitsu","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-01T14:15:04Z","branch":"newjitsu","commit_sha":"7ab4a1c8c0583b52087060c0bf8a71d9af05fd3c","github_link":"https://github.com/jitsucom/jitsu/commit/7ab4a1c8c0583b52087060c0bf8a71d9af05fd3c","commit_subject":"fix(sync-sidecar): retry Postgres operations instead of panicking (JITSU-233) (#1527)","ai_tool":"